        {
          "post_id": "542124",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2967\">Solve the recurrence:</p><p data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3006\">$T(n) = T(n/5) + T(4n/5) + O(n)$</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3086\">$O(n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3086\">$O(n\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3086\">$O(n^2)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3086\">$O(\\log n)$</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "B",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "subject": "Algorithms",
          "day": "Day 238"
        },
        {
          "post_id": "542116",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1770\">For $T(n,n)$, consider:</p><p data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1807\">$T(x,c) = \\Theta(x)$ for $c \\leq 2$</p><p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1840\">$T(x,y) = \\Theta(x) + S(x,y/2)$</p><p data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1877\">$S(c,y) = \\Theta(y)$ for $c \\leq 2$</p><p data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1910\">$S(x,y) = \\Theta(y) + T(x/2,y)$</p><p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"716\"><br>What is the asymptotic complexity of $T(n,n)$?</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n^2)$</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "B",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "subject": "Algorithms",
          "day": "Day 238"
        },
        {
          "post_id": "542118",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2407\">Solve the recurrence:</p><p data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2432\">$T(n) = T(n-2) + \\log n$</p><p data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2474\">Assume $T(n)$ is constant for small $n$.</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2554\">$O(\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2554\">$O(n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2554\">$O(n\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2554\">$O(n^2)$</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "C",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "subject": "Algorithms",
          "day": "Day 238"
        },
        {
          "post_id": "542112",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"557\">For $T(n,n)$, consider:</p><p data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"594\">$T(x,c) = \\Theta(x)$ for $c \\leq 2$</p><p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"631\">$T(c,y) = \\Theta(y)$ for $c \\leq 2$</p><p data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"668\">$T(x,y) = \\Theta(x+y) + T(x/2,y/2)$</p><p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"716\"><br>What is the asymptotic complexity of $T(n,n)$?</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n^2)$</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "B",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "subject": "Algorithms",
          "day": "Day 238"
        },
        {
          "post_id": "542114",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1167\">For $T(n,n)$, consider:</p><p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1204\">$T(x,c) = \\Theta(x)$ for $c \\leq 2$</p><p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1241\">$T(c,y) = \\Theta(y)$ for $c \\leq 2$</p><p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1274\">$T(x,y) = \\Theta(x) + T(x,y/2)$<br>&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"716\">What is the asymptotic complexity of $T(n,n)$?</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n\\log n)$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"796\">$\\Theta(n^2)$</li></ol>",
